ll make this season's CFP.","published":"2026-11-22T06:30:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/playoffpredictions112126/cfp-predictions-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN Staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College Football Playoff top 12 projection after Week 12","description":"We assess how the selection committee could stack the top teams in the country after Week 12.","published":"2026-11-22T06:55:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552244/projecting-2026-playoff-top-12-week-12-cfp","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-22T05:08:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's jab at Ohio State's 'THE' leads top Week 12 CFB trolls","description":"Nebraska deployed a simple but effective troll that poked fun at its opponent's propensity to emphasize the \"the\" in \"The Ohio State University.\"","published":"2026-11-22T04:22:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50554531/nebraska-ohio-state-trolls-college-football-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia clinches SEC title game berth with win at South Carolina","description":"Nate Frazier ran for 94 yards and two touchdowns, and No. 1 Georgia clinched a spot in the final SEC championship game with a victory over South Carolina on Saturday night.","published":"2026-11-22T05:47:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558713/georgia-clinches-sec-title-game-berth-win-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T04:00:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami tops Virginia Tech, to face Wake Forest in ACC title game","description":"Miami will play Wake Forest in the ACC title game on Dec. 5 after both teams won on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-22T04:46:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50558418/miami-tops-virginia-tech-face-wake-forest-acc-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Betting buzz: Big Ten's odds of national champion four-peat getting slim","description":"Losses by UCLA, Indiana and Ohio State make the Big Ten's chances of winning the national championship this season a long shot.","published":"2026-11-22T04:06:20.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/49921234/college-football-betting-buzz-odds-updates-line-moves-spreads","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Emotional Greg Schiano authors 'special' win, Rutgers' first at PSU since 1988","description":"Less than two weeks after Rutgers announced embattled Greg Schiano would return as coach for a 19th season, the Scarlet Knights stunned Penn State 25-24 on Saturday, their first win over the Nittany Lions since 1988, and just their third this year.","published":"2026-11-22T02:56:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50557643/rutgers-authors-special-win-1st-penn-state-1988","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4905925/devan-thompkins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins"},"pick":{"pick":31,"round":1,"team":"SF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Devan Thompkins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:13Z","intro":"Devan Thompkins is an American college football defensive tackle for the Alabama Crimson Tide. He previously played for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Thompkins attended St. Mary's High School in Stockton, California for three years before transferring to Edison High School in Stockton for his senior year. He played basketball at St. Mary's and did not play football until his senior year at Edison. He played defensive end and tight end in high school and had nine tackles and caught three passes for 24 yards. Thompkins committed to the University of Southern California (USC) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Thompkins played in three combined games his first two years at USC in 2022 and 2023. In 2024, he started six of 13 games and recorded 24 tackles and 1.5 sacks. In 2025, he had 31 tackles and three sacks. After the season, Thompkins entered the transfer portal."}]}}